{"_v":1,"id":"the-playboy-of-the-western-world-west-end-2025","bd":{"positive":1,"mixed":6,"negative":0},"rv":[{"cn":"Nick Curtis","o":"Evening Standard","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.standard.co.uk/culture/theatre/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-national-theatre-review-nicola-coughlan-b1262173.html","q":"A curiously downbeat finale to an uneven evening."},{"cn":"Arifa Akbar","o":"The Guardian","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.theguardian.com/stage/2025/dec/12/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-review-lyttelton-theatre-london","q":"But there are bumpy transitions between the drama of the first half, with a subtly twisting tension and notes of anxiety, to the physical comedy and outright farce of the second."},{"cn":"Holly O'Mahony","o":"London Theatre","s":79,"b":"Positive","t":2,"u":"https://www.londontheatre.co.uk/reviews/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-review-national-theatre","q":"It’s a brilliant and satisfying production that will leave audiences thinking long after the show ends."},{"cn":"Alice Saville","o":"The Independent","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.independent.co.uk/arts-entertainment/theatre-dance/reviews/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-nicola-coughlan-b2883264.html","q":"It's not a straightforward watch – but its leads have got enough vigour and wit to carry us through."},{"cn":"Unknown","o":"The Stage","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.thestage.co.uk/reviews/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-review-lyttelton-theatre-national-theatre-london-caitriona-mclaughlin-nicola-coughlan","q":"Strong performances from Nicola Coughlan and Declan Conlon hold together this uneven, oddly paced study"},{"cn":"Anya Ryan","o":"Time Out London","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.timeout.com/london/theatre/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-3-review","q":"It is a real shame, then, that the production feels so tonally muddled."},{"cn":"Alun Hood","o":"WhatsOnStage","s":60,"b":"Mixed","t":2,"u":"https://www.whatsonstage.com/news/the-playboy-of-the-western-world-at-the-national-theatre-review_1706313/","q":"This is a sumptuous production, rich in detail, craft and spectacle. It's impressive but dramatically inert."}],"au":{"score":58,"designation":"Loathing","sources":{"mz":{"s":58,"c":228,"sr":2.9}}},"hi":"https://images.ctfassets.net/6pezt69ih962/1hNgUrkqy7V5XogBnoENF0/7d15a610fccdc8241b5ce0be1d053e7a/NTGDS_JD_TPOTWW_TodayTix_OnSale_Rollout_5.jpg"}